  <div class="hw-step__body">
    <h2>Talking to the engine</h2>
    <p>The server exposes a REST API over FastAPI. No auth, no keys, no rate limits. Just POST your query and get back results. Title-based searches work out of the box. Text queries and mood blending need Ollama running locally with the Qwen3-Embedding model.</p>
    <div class="hw-api-example">
      <div class="hw-api-example__req"><span class="hw-api-example__label mono">POST /recommend/similar</span><pre class="hw-api-example__code"><code>{'{'}
  "title": "Inception",
  "limit": 12
{'}'}</code></pre></div>
      <svg class="hw-api-example__arr" viewBox="0 0 24 40" width="24" height="40" fill="none"><path d="M12 0 v28" stroke="#2a2a2a" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M6 26 l6 6 6-6" fill="none" stroke="#b4ff39" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
      <div class="hw-api-example__res"><span class="hw-api-example__label mono">200 OK (one result of 12)</span><pre class="hw-api-example__code"><code>{'{'}
  "rank": 1,
  "title": "Interstellar",
  "primary_genre": "Science Fiction",
  "genres": "Sci-Fi, Adventure, Drama",
  "year": 2014,
  "vote_average": 8.4,
  "score": 0.892
{'}'}</code></pre></div>
    </div>
    <h3 class="hw-subtitle">All endpoints</h3>
    <div class="hw-endpoint-grid">
      <div class="hw-ep"><span class="hw-ep__method mono hw-ep__method--get">GET</span><span class="hw-ep__path mono">/health</span><span class="hw-ep__about">liveness check</span></div>
      <div class="hw-ep"><span class="hw-ep__method mono hw-ep__method--get">GET</span><span class="hw-ep__path mono">/stats</span><span class="hw-ep__about">index and DB counts</span></div>
      <div class="hw-ep"><span class="hw-ep__method mono hw-ep__method--post">POST</span><span class="hw-ep__path mono">/recommend/similar</span><span class="hw-ep__about">movies like a title</span></div>
      <div class="hw-ep"><span class="hw-ep__method mono hw-ep__method--post">POST</span><span class="hw-ep__path mono">/recommend/query</span><span class="hw-ep__about">movies matching text</span></div>
      <div class="hw-ep"><span class="hw-ep__method mono hw-ep__method--post">POST</span><span class="hw-ep__path mono">/recommend/profile</span><span class="hw-ep__about">taste profile search</span></div>
      <div class="hw-ep"><span class="hw-ep__method mono hw-ep__method--post">POST</span><span class="hw-ep__path mono">/recommend/diverse</span><span class="hw-ep__about">max diversity with DPP</span></div>
      <div class="hw-ep"><span class="hw-ep__method mono hw-ep__method--post">POST</span><span class="hw-ep__path mono">/recommend/explore</span><span class="hw-ep__about">serendipity mode</span></div>
      <div class="hw-ep"><span class="hw-ep__method mono hw-ep__method--get">GET</span><span class="hw-ep__path mono">/movies/{'{'}id{'}'}</span><span class="hw-ep__about">single movie</span></div>
      <div class="hw-ep"><span class="hw-ep__method mono hw-ep__method--get">GET</span><span class="hw-ep__path mono">/movies/search?q=</span><span class="hw-ep__about">FTS5 search</span></div>
      <div class="hw-ep"><span class="hw-ep__method mono hw-ep__method--get">GET</span><span class="hw-ep__path mono">/movies/browse?genre=</span><span class="hw-ep__about">filtered browse</span></div>
      <div class="hw-ep"><span class="hw-ep__method mono hw-ep__method--get">GET</span><span class="hw-ep__path mono">/movies/genres</span><span class="hw-ep__about">all genres</span></div>
      <div class="hw-ep"><span class="hw-ep__method mono hw-ep__method--get">GET</span><span class="hw-ep__path mono">/ranker/features</span><span class="hw-ep__about">feature importance</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
